Package: antigravity-quota-monitor
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Antigravity Tools <support@antigravity.google>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, python3-dbus, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-appindicator3-0.1 | gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1, python3-cairo
Description: Real-time Antigravity Quota Monitor for Ubuntu GNOME Desktop
 Native Ubuntu/GNOME desktop utility to monitor Google Antigravity
 remaining quota in real-time on the GNOME Top Bar, providing
 detailed breakdown cards, SQLite usage history, and CLI tooling.
